.TH AVR\-CONFIG\-SET 1 "" "avr 0.1.5" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-config-set \- Set a CLI configuration value.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr config set
[OPTIONS] {org} VALUE
.SH DESCRIPTION
Set a CLI configuration value.
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
Available keys:
  org   Active organization (ID or slug)
.fi
.RE
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
Examples:
    avr config set org org-abc123
    avr config set org acme
.fi
.RE
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
\fIKEY\fR
(choices: org)
.TP
\fIVALUE\fR
\&
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR avr (1),
.BR avr-config (1),
.BR avr-config-get (1),
.BR avr-config-list (1),
.BR avr-config-unset (1)
